    "paragraph": "This study analyzes US one-way commuting times from 2006 to 2024 using American Community Survey data alongside travel-diary comparisons from Europe and England. Another study analyzed the relationship between the neighborhood built environment and five mental health outcomes across 356 neighborhoods in Tehran, Iran. Finally, a strategic framework was established to transition South Korea's Incheon Free Economic Zone from a traditional smart city to an AI-driven urban model.",
